{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "e7897fa0d2479f061192afbdbc984475d80af89c78cccff2078a751059996bc9", "ja": "憧憬のリアライズ", "zh": "憧憬Realize", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "34a6f68ad0571ba060f8869d50c458c0460f56e211e6f358b512198e87a0423f", "ja": "ドラマ『階のスターエレメンツ』の放送が\n始まる。3人の熱演は好評。皆で感想の手紙\nを読んでいると、切磋琢磨の意味がわかった\nと独自の答えを言う未来。未来らしいと笑い\nながらも、成長を感じるプロデューサー。", "zh": "电视剧《阶梯上的Star Elements》正式\n开播，三人的精采演出大受好评。在阅读观众\n的感想信时，未来表示已经了解切磋琢磨的\n意思，并说出独特的答案。制作人笑着说\n很有未来的风格，同时也感受到她的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d33f946de0c5492ba2e0652b8585b99209ab22412c7ed9a5b8ea5fd1153a4c41", "ja": "（ドラマ『階のスターエレメンツ』は\n大きなトラブルもなく撮影を終了……）", "zh": "（电视剧《阶梯上的Star Elements》\n一路都没有遭遇大问题，顺利结束拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1e9f15b38dbb13a407c22363b8fd746dae4820872f4fc58b75eaa34a1d631b26", "ja": "（そして放送が始まるやいなや、未来達の\n熱い演技が、大きな反響を呼ぶ事になった！）", "zh": "（接着，未来等人的动人演技\n在开播后立刻引起了广大回响！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "bf2c0490007c105ede3e6e516002239284d48738d889504a9be90a756b5618be", "ja": "え～っ！　『階のスターエレメンツ』の\nトークイベントをやるんですか？", "zh": "咦～！\n要举办《阶梯上的Star Elements》的谈话活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f159512d1e5f42b917ecb904d471856ca514bee661f121553715f90dec440d47", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。\nドラマの好評を受けて、急遽行うことになった。", "zh": "没错，因为电视剧大受好评，\n所以临时决定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2144e5eae9db63ddaf9bf13bb48193950bf7f0032961f6a44df47e1cc573edf8", "ja": "ドラマのトークかあ……。\nどんな話をすればいいのかな？", "zh": "电视剧的谈话活动啊……\n要说什么才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "48872951b9a23cf58579f591248b00b6033e47a02b60db1049c4181854c25dc2", "ja": "そうだね。ドラマを見てくれた人は、やっぱり裏話が\n聞きたいんじゃないかな？　役作りでの苦労とか……。", "zh": "这个嘛，电视剧的观众应该会想听幕后秘辛吧？\n像是揣摩角色时遇上的困难之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "842cf9ab1c9eba8202d90b79ce19276dc718876c9e23730bee3f2dacb6decaf1", "ja": "じゃあ未来ちゃんは、\nあのことの話で決まりだね♪", "zh": "那未来当然是要讲那件事啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "f5566ba4e7be09b9199036e87dfad59ab8a3d201085ec46f2a5b459db70fe377", "ja": "あのことって……私が最初にうまくできなくて、\nひとりだけで練習してたこと？", "zh": "那件事是指……我一开始演得不顺，\n一个人单独练习的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "4978ff0a97b0a10c605a978c0268d1da404d34b4de086f3ae4a3d4af8bb05f01", "ja": "でも、お客さんに話すの、\nなんかちょっと恥ずかしいなあ～。", "zh": "但跟观众说这些，\n感觉有点不好意思耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "9951c056a33115af508ae296e2238126d541b7c64dc8ed835a1919d3d9874585", "ja": "いいんじゃない？　未来のあの演技がどうやって\nできたのか、みんな知りたいと思うけど。", "zh": "没关系吧。\n大家应该都想知道未来是如何摸索出那样的演技的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "15eca95d0517e605998dcd8fa769f1e1647802261ff908f9724c630fc9595dbd", "ja": "そうそう。わたし、ドラマ見てびっくりしたもん！\n未来そっくりな顔の、別の人かと思った！", "zh": "没错没错，我看电视剧时吓了一跳！\n还以为是长得跟未来一模一样的陌生人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "002f83e6e20b44c1495ec33aee08034b9fa10fc38335e7a0b2d80b5121ae8562", "ja": "そんな人いないよ～！\nけど、なんかうれしいな。でへへへ……♪", "zh": "没有那种人啦～！\n但感觉好开心啊，嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "c58bc707cde67daf36abe4fe290e5d76817748b9148014c747d6b834e37ea150", "ja": "あ！　それじゃあ私は、\n志保ちゃんにアドバイスもらったことを話すね！", "zh": "啊！\n那我就讲志保给我建议的事好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "ca647ccf24a9a0dbaa6e79d87729e2fd7b47e7d46a21effaff0340c5d4f9be23", "ja": "そんなこと、言わなくてもいいのに……。可奈が\n自分でやったんだから、そう言えばいいでしょ。", "zh": "那种事有什么好讲的……\n这是可奈你自己努力的成果，直接这么说不就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "877a36c541a77af220e27f8ec7ead12b0867f4c89a422403c149ff0c00a1af35", "ja": "そんなことない！\n私だけの力なんかじゃないよ。", "zh": "才没这回事！\n才不是光靠我自己的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f78807b6c39546756ce664bac720f126826ac0277683a7fda9c7b2973aa2e17", "ja": "志保ちゃんと、未来ちゃんと琴葉さん……。\nみんながいたから、私、がんばれたんだもん！", "zh": "因为有志保、未来、琴叶……\n因为有大家在，我才能努力演出呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "80c7a236ff637e2c5613d0692a3940809f7dbda870195f2db9df39cca3fb76d3", "ja": "そうだね。私も、この3人……それに\n劇場のみんながいたから、できたことだと思う。", "zh": "说得没错，多亏我们三人能一起演戏……\n还有剧场的大家给予支持，我才能顺利演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "3267d3a06844293a47a59454dbc01313cef5bcef4cb7aedd8f1d02ccc78960ea", "ja": "大勢の仲間がいて、たくさんの刺激をくれる。\n私が今、こうしてがんばれるのも、きっとそのおかげ。", "zh": "我能坚持努力到现在，\n一定是因为有许多伙伴带给我不同的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "beb582e9e7807d3e9b7e5fdb784442a5cedb7e7974a6ce2ff7b693089212a30d", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\nこれ、事務室に忘れていきませんでしたか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n你是不是把这个忘在事务室了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5032098d3d606543e68aac21233de61645781a1b57375dc2b9e0ec67af3bec6a", "ja": "春香？　あ、それは……ドラマの感想か。\nわざわざ持ってきてくれたんだな、ありがとう！", "zh": "春香？啊，那是……电视剧的感想啊。\n你特地帮我送过来啊，谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "118115db26384adca227d03995172c388e14d4ccf4e62617dba661df691a3a88", "ja": "あっ、春香さんだ♪　こんにちは～！", "zh": "啊，是春香♪你好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "37fdee3cbe9a7cfadad129f7a24399031dc244a498ed4cd4e1522ddf92edac8d", "ja": "ふふっ、こんにちは、未来ちゃん！\nみんなも、お疲れさま♪", "zh": "呵呵，你好，未来！\n大家都辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "931f01603fc700267c0d43a190c516e2208bd5b5f7cd98e397fd4a7735a17054", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "8ebfd5841ab0b541688be9cb2c269d3d12d333f82406396cd85d361bee63b60f", "ja": "……それ、何ですか？　手紙？", "zh": "……那是什么？是信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "36a5522d8250c3bad07169f94a1107cab80dafc5e83aa69e892384c6bf14c674", "ja": "ああ。視聴者の人達から寄せられた、ドラマの感想だ。\nぜひ、3人にも読んでほしいと思ってな。", "zh": "没错，是观众寄来的电视剧感想。\n我非常希望你们三人也能读一读。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "f6850df294f019f08e6e2fba0b9d3c08af3c036dbb891f5cd221c37c3b3dec7e", "ja": "私も見たよ、3人のドラマ。\n未来ちゃん、短期間ですっごく上手になってたね！", "zh": "我也有看你们三个演的电视剧喔，\n未来，你的演技在短时间内变得非常好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "60edcfbcf6af817adfb391c7b4c090382739273425116b3f79ea97f42d035baa", "ja": "私も、ボーッとしてられないなって思ったよ。\n未来ちゃんたちに負けないように、頑張らなくちゃ！", "zh": "让我觉得自己不能再原地踏步了，\n我也要好好努力，不能输给未来你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "1b1d71f1a5859f407c766a13dca26ddb3f28c0ad3a9db0e60a5648b8fb84a455", "ja": "ホントですか～！？\nやった、春香さんにほめられちゃった♪", "zh": "真的吗～！？\n太棒了，被春香夸奖了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "c485eaea67b7f3e163e671d75cd26730a3ba3930bb322ceb6e05dc26add4812c", "ja": "よかったね、未来ちゃん！", "zh": "真是太好了呢，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "7e2eef8ae8e1bc50c5e5feb69ec5892686bbf6bd5a0e9feb411656016691cfec", "ja": "{$P$}さん。それで、\nどんな感想だったんですか？　私も聞きたいな♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n所以到底是什么样的感想呢？我也好想听喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "72a293823f5026d551948e367a96b43da2f932bb87d4bf9a8fc673f643aa44e6", "ja": "そうだな。\nじゃあせっかくだから、読みあげようか。", "zh": "这样啊。\n那就趁这个机会，我念给大家听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9e014ded150d1cee8ca9916c6d3d244390a3d11d60526c28f438b91f57b2e6aa", "ja": "『階のスターエレメンツ、大変楽しませて頂きました。\n互いに切磋琢磨する少女達の生き生きとした姿が……』", "zh": "『我非常喜欢《阶梯上的Star Elements》。\n剧中生动地刻划出互相切磋琢磨的少女们……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c2724ae19ba068bdceaedd259f2843263f16c1566928ea2d09ca02f443764ad", "ja": "ああっ！！", "zh": "啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "313f8afad073ac5adc92e0e84a1d5198346de25b2887d44e346676f5bec4b441", "ja": "わあっ！？　びっくりした、未来ちゃん、どうしたの？\n間違って、明日のおやつも今日食べちゃったとか？", "zh": "哇啊！？吓我一跳，未来，你怎么了？\n今天就不小心把明天的零食吃掉了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "46c6a1bc2aa74b07e665de353b2d388e7862e9dc1059da3bc17274f64dd6d2a4", "ja": "違う違う、セッサタクマ！\n私、セッサタクマの意味がわかったの！", "zh": "不是不是，是切磋琢磨！\n我知道切磋琢磨的意思了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "ddae71af802ebbba3bad7bd14e5776ab58f0f95467a414fe3859ef11107934db", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ。未来、ドラマの撮影で\n忙しかったのに、ちゃんと勉強したんだね。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n未来，原来你忙着拍戏之余，也有认真学习呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "893cde412d76b34a067c0d20ebc2831bc48699a144b9cd7fe7bd09a564778e11", "ja": "勉強したんじゃなくて、わかったんです！\nいいですか？　当てますよ～！", "zh": "这不是学到的，我是靠自己理解了！\n可以了吗？我要猜啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "cc05b6fbbabf3c8448b4d4fd2a7a1ea42879a7b1f273c110a964105eae0a33e5", "ja": "セッサタクマの意味、それは……。", "zh": "切磋琢磨的意思就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "21fa2c84b6be80a277f012fa9c4631f4cb1ff7f5baddb1cad2c98866777de6a1", "ja": "それは……？", "zh": "就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f726183e5824241bfa5d1cb56d7cefc711f12a0be018de34f7e343bc6b54fd6", "ja": "『みんなが大好きだから、がんばる！』\n……ってことですよね♪", "zh": "『因为我超喜欢大家，所以要加油！』\n……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "d3f09f4d6dfe25d1013e741b14d967b98976b8adb7f595704eb163dd46102493", "ja": "……んっ？", "zh": "……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1042_001har", "source_sha256": "ef47b560e2e4c73c5e9f2567ed85f05526eca37fdc4d49f0f97b27abc56211e1", "ja": "ふふっ！", "zh": "呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "7f2dbf2886747aedb1324f8fcc030bc66b551ed8c2045ddc10b0e5c8896121a0", "ja": "あれ？\n……もしかして、間違っちゃいました？", "zh": "咦？\n……我该不会搞错了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "1d764b5c1949cc3df0b35ed702a8b380ea1fdb9643dffc7ba6b8fe5117265998", "ja": "いや……まあ、だいたい合ってるかな。\n未来らしい、いい答えだと思うよ。", "zh": "不……好吧，大致上是对的吧。\n我觉得这是很有未来风格的好答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "9fe1fb710c53ffed08d968efd6cc4726b69ee852912e2e73ea3e9c03337b00d6", "ja": "わーい、ありがとうございます！\nでへへ♪", "zh": "哇～谢谢你！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "09bb60789c6af6e1a6a121a75c42fb4aa15d4e006a96e539bf866128e5ca4313", "ja": "そんな未来の答えも好きだけど……。琴葉、後で\n国語的な正解も教えてやってくれ。将来のために。", "zh": "虽然我也喜欢未来的答案……但之后就拜托琴叶教她\n正确的含意了，这也是为了她的将来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "64b36556478d7099a7171b61ec177c4645d6dd163a92d9cf076f57d5d629ac44", "ja": "ふふ、はい。\nそれじゃ、後でちゃんと教えておきますね！", "zh": "呵呵，好的，\n我之后会再好好教她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1049_p", "source_sha256": "a7c06790b66c1bc5311d76b1d082c2b5794cdd32580e8013413e93bbec6478ac", "ja": "（ともかく、劇場のアイドル達はこれからも\n互いに競い合い、成長していくことだろう）", "zh": "（总之，剧场的偶像们接下来也会继续互相较劲、\n一同成长吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_07_1050_p", "source_sha256": "b536969ab6968c9c46e9d21965d8617f13d7af94695eee48b0f8bcc5c1487455", "ja": "（みんなが一体、どんな高みに行きつくのか……\nそれを見届けるのが、今から楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（大家究竟会攀升到什么样的高度呢……\n我已经开始期待见证那个过程了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
